  <para style="h">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete ryanditswe na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete ryanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Jewe Yakobo, umukozi w’Imana n’uw’Umwami Yesu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="JAS 1:1">Ndabaramukije mwebwe abo mu miryango cumi n’ibiri mwasanzariye mu mahanga.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amageragezwa n’amarushwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Bene Data, munezerwe cane, igihe cose muhuye n’ibibagerageza vy’uburyo bwinshi, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kuko muzi neza ko iyo ukwizera kwanyu kugeragejwe bituma ukwihangana kwanyu na kwo gukura. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ukwihangana kumaze gukura, guca guheraheza igikorwa cakwo kugira ngo mubeho muri abantu bakuze kandi mukwije vyose, ata co muhajije. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Nihaba hariho uwo muri mwebwe akeneye ubwenge bw’Imana, akwiye kubusaba Imana, kuko itanga cane kandi ibikunze. Nta we itera imiragwe kuko ayisavye, kandi azobuhabwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ariko igihe asaba, abe yizeye adakekeranya, kuko umuntu akekeranya ameze nk’umupfunda wo mu kiyaga, uhuhwa kandi uzungagizwa n’umuyaga. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Umeze atyo ntiyitege ko hariho ico azoronka kivuye ku Mwami Imana; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />kuko ntiyiyeguriye Imana, afise imitima ibiri, ntashikamye mu kintu cose akora.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Abizera kandi bakenye barafise ico bakwiye kwishimira, kuko Imana yabashize hejuru. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Ariko abatunzi bo, bakwiye kwishimira ko Imana yabacishije bugufi. Kuko bazokurwaho kurya kw’ishurwe ryo mw’ishamba. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Izuba ryatse ubushuhe bwaryo bwumisha igiterwa; ishurwe ryaco rigakoroka n’ubwiza bwaryo bugakurwaho. Uko ni ko n’umutunzi azokwuma ari mu bikorwa vyiwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Hahiriwe umuntu yihanganira ibimugerageza, kuko inyuma y’ukugeragezwa, niyarama azohabwa urugori rw’ubugingo Imana yasezeraniye abayikunda.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Iyo muntu ageragejwe, ntakwiye kuvuga ngo: “Imana iriko irangerageza.” Kuko Imana itageragezwa n’ikibi, kandi ntigerageza umuntu n’umwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ariko, umuntu wese ageragezwa n’ivyipfuzo vyiwe bibi, hanyuma bikamusunikira mu mutego. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ivyo vyipfuzo bimaze gutwara inda, bivyara icaha. Icaha na co kimaze gukura, kikavyara urupfu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ntimuhendwe bene Data nkunda. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Ingabire yose nziza kandi itunganye iva ku Mana Data, yaremye umuco wose wo mw’ijuru, kandi muri we ntihigera habaho guhindagurika kurya kw’igitutu. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Yahisemwo kutuvyaza ijambo ry’ukuri, kugira ngo tube nk’ivyeze ubwa mbere mu vyo yaremye vyose.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwumva ijambo no kurishira mu ngiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Bene Data bakundwa, mumenye iki: umuntu wese yihute kwumva, yitonde mu kuvuga, atebe kuraka, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />kuko ukuraka kw’umuntu kutamushikana ku bugororotsi Imana ishaka. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nuko rero, mwitandukanye cane n’ibintu vyose bishobora kubanduza, hamwe n’ikibi cose, mwemere muciye bugufi ijambo ritewe muri mwebwe, rifise ubushobozi bwo kubarokora.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Kandi iryo Jambo ntimupfe kuryumviriza gusa, mwihenda. Ahubwo mukore ico ribabwira. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Umuntu wese yumviriza iryo jambo ariko ntarishire mu ngiro ameze nk’umuntu yiraba mu maso mu cirore <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />hanyuma, amaze kwiraba akagenda agaca yiyibagira ubwo nyene uko asa. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ariko uwusuzuma neza ivyagezwe bitunganye kandi bitanga umwidegemvyo, hanyuma agashishikara kubikora, ntiyibagire ivyo yumvise, ariko akabishira mu ngiro, uwo ni we azohabwa umugisha mu vyo akora.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Abiyumvira ko bemewe kubera idini ryabo, ariko ntibirinde mu vyo bavuga, baba bihenda kandi kuba mw’idini kwabo nta co bimaze. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Idini ryemewe kandi ritunganye imbere y’Imana Data wa twese ni ukwitaho impfuvyi n’abapfakazi mu marushwa yabo no kwirinda kwanduzwa n’isi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kwirinda kurobanura ku butoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Bene Data, abizera Umwami wacu w’ubwiza Yesu Kristo, ntibarobanura ku butoni. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Nk’akarorero hinjiye umuntu mw’ikoraniro ryanyu yambaye impeta y’inzahabu n’impuzu nziza, hakinjira n’uwundi yambaye impuzu zishize. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Iyo mwitayeho cane wa wundi yambaye neza mukamubwira muti: “Ehe ng’iki ikibanza ciza canyu,” ariko mukabwira wa mukene muti: “Wewe hagarara harya” canke muti: “Icara hasi i ruhande y’ibirenge vyanje,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />mbega ntimuba mwiciyemwo ibice hagati yanyu kandi mugaca imanza mufise intumbero mbi?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Umviriza bene Data nkunda. Mbega Imana ntiyatoranije abitwa abakene muvy’iyi si ngo babe abatunzi mu vyo kwizera no kuzoragwa Ubwami yasezeraniye abayikunda? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ariko mwebwe mutetereza umukene! Mbega si abatunzi babacuranguza bongera babashengeza mu bucamanza? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Mbega si bo bacokora rya zina ryiza mwitirirwa?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mugira neza, nimwaba vy’ukuri mukizigamye ca cagezwe kiri mu Vyanditswe kivuga ngo: “Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Abalewi 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ariko, nimwaba mukirobanura abantu ku butoni, muzoba mucumuye kandi mutsinzwe n’urubanza rw’uko murenga ku vyagezwe. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Kuko uwitondera ivyagezwe vyose ariko agatsitara kuri kimwe acirirwa urubanza nk’uwabicumuyeko vyose. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Kuko Imana yavuze ngo: “Ntugasambane”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kuvayo 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Gusubiramwo 5:18</ref></char></char></note> ni na yo yavuze ngo: “Ntukice.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kuvayo 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Gusubiramwo 5:17</ref></char></char></note> Rero naho utosambana ariko ukica, uzoba warenze ku vyagezwe.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Mu mvugo no mu ngiro, mukore nk’abazocirwa urubanza n’ivyagezwe bitanga umwidegemvyo, <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />kuko mu guca imanza, Imana atazogirira imbabazi abanse kuzigirira abandi. Ariko abagira imbabazi bazozigirirwa, kuko imbabazi zitsinda urubanza!<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwizera n’ibikorwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Mbega vyomara iki ga bene Data, nimba umuntu avuga ko afise ukwizera ariko ntakwerekanishe ibikorwa? Mbega ukwizera ben’ukwo kwoshobora kumukiza? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Dufate ko hari mwene Data atagira ico yambara canke ico afungura. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Hamwe umwe muri mwebwe yomubwira ati: “Niwigire amahoro, wambare neza kandi ufungure,” ariko ntagire ico akora, yoba amufashije iki? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ni ko bimeze, n’ukwizera kwonyene kudaherekejwe n’ibikorwa, kuba gupfuye.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ariko hariho uwoshobora kuvuga ati: “Bamwe bafise ukwizera, abandi na bo bafise ibikorwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 2:18">Ariko, jewe nanje nomubaza nti: “Ni gute ushobora kunyereka ukwizera kwawe kandi ata bikorwa? Jewe nokwereka ukwizera kwanje mu kukwereka ibikorwa vyiza.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Uvuga ko ufise ukwizera kuko wizera ko hari Imana imwe. Ivyo ni vyiza! Ariko n’abadayimoni ivyo baravyizera, mbere bakanajugumira kubera gutinya.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Mbega imburabwenge! Ukeneye ikikwemeza ko ukwizera kutagira ibikorwa ata co kumaze? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Mbega sogokuruza wacu Aburahamu ntiyiswe umugororotsi kubera ivyo yakoze, mu kwemera gutanga Isaka nk’ikimazi ku gicaniro? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Urabona rero ko ukwizera kwiwe n’ibikorwa vyiwe vyose vyakoreye hamwe, ukwizera kwiwe kukuzuzwa n’ibikorwa yakoze. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Hanyuma Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Aburahamu yizeye Imana bituma imwemera nk’umugororotsi,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Itanguriro 15:6</ref></char></char></note> birashitswa mbere aca yitwa umukunzi w’Imana. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Urabona rero ko umuntu yemerwa ko agororotse kubera ibikorwa biherekeza ukwizera ariko atari ukwizera kwonyene.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kandi muri iyo ntumbero nyene, mbega Rahabu maraya ntiyemewe nk’uwugororotse bivuye ku vyo yakoze igihe yaha indaro ba batasi kandi akabarungika abacishije mu yindi nzira? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Nk’uko umubiri utagira impwemu uba upfuye ni ko n’ukwizera kudaherekejwe n’ibikorwa kuba gupfuye.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gufata ururimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Bene Data, ntihakabeho benshi bipfuza kuba abigisha, kuko muzi ko twebwe twigisha tuzocirwa imanza zikomeye kuruta iz’abandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Nk’uko bisanzwe, twese dukora ibibi mu buryo bwinshi. Nihaba hariho umuntu adacumura mu kuvuga kwiwe, uwo ni umuntu atunganye, ashobora no kuzigama umubiri wiwe wose.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Iyo dushize umugozi mu kanwa k’amafarasi kugira ngo atuyoboke, dushobora kwerekeza imibiri yayo yose iyo dushaka. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Canke reka dufate akarorero ku bwato. Naho bwoba bunini gute kandi bukubebwa n’imiyaga ikomeye, ingafe ntoya ni yo ibutumbereza iyo uwubuyobora ashaka. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ni ko biri no ku rurimi. Ni urugingo rutoya mu zigize umubiri, ariko rwihayagiza muri vyinshi. Raba ingene ishamba rinini rishobora kudomekwa n’akariro gake. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />N’ururimi na rwo rumeze nk’umuriro; ni nk’isi y’ikibi iri mu ngingo z’imibiri yacu. Rushobora kwanduza umubiri w’umuntu wose, rukadomeka ukubaho kwiwe kwose, kandi na rwo rudomekwa na Gehinomu.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ibikoko vy’ubwoko bwose, inyoni, ibikwega inda hasi n’ibiba mu biyaga umuntu ashobora kubiganza kandi yarabiganje koko, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />ariko nta muntu ashobora kuganza neza ururimi rwiwe. Ni ikibi kitaruhuka, cuzuye ubumara bwica.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Mu gihe kimwe usanga ururimi ari rwo duhimbarisha Umwami Imana Data wa twese, mu kindi gihe akaba ari rwo tuvumisha abantu, baremwe mw’ishusho y’Imana. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu kanwa kamwe hakavamwo uguhimbaza n’ukuvumana. Bene Data, uko si ko vyari bikwiye kumera. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Mbega mw’isoko imwe hovamwo amazi meza n’ayandi arura? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Bene Data, mbega umusukoni wokwama ivyamwa vya elayo, canke uruzabibu rwokwama insukoni? Ntibishoboka, uko ni ko n’isoko y’amazi arura idashobora kuvamwo amazi meza.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwenge bw’uburyo bubiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Muri mwebwe ni nde ari umunyabwenge kandi atahura? Navyerekane mu ngeso nziza ziwe, no mu bikorwa vyiwe birangwa no guca bugufi kuva ku bwenge bw’ukuri. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ariko nimwaba mwuzuye ishari, umururazi n’ukwikunda, ntimwishimire ubwo bwenge kuko mwoba mwihakanye ukuri. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />“Ubwenge” nk’ubwo ntibwururuka buva mw’ijuru ariko ni ubw’isi, si ubw’impwemu, ni ubwa wa mubi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Kuko aho ishari n’ukwikunda vyiganziye, ni naho hari umuvurungano n’ibikorwa bibi vyose.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ariko ubwenge buva mw’ijuru ubwa mbere na mbere buratunganye rwose; bukunda amahoro, ntibwishira imbere, buciye bugufi, bwuzuye imbabazi, bwama ivyamwa vyiza, ntibugira nkunzi, ntibugira uburyarya. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Kandi abaremesha amahoro bazobiba imbuto z’amahoro bimbure umwimbu witwa ubugororotsi.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Guca bugufi imbere y’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Mbega ni iki gitera intambara n’imitongano muri mwebwe? Mbega ntibiva mu vyipfuzo vyanyu bibi bigwanira muri mwebwe? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Murashaka kuronka ikintu ntimukironke, mugaca mwica kugira ngo mukironke. Muripfuza, ariko ntimushobora kuronka ico mwipfuza, mugaca mutongana mbere mukanagwana. Ntimuronka ivyo mukeneye kuko mutabisaba Imana. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Mbere n’iyo musavye ntimuhabwa, kuko musaba mufise intumbero mbi, mushaka gukoresha ivyo muronse mu bihimbaro vyanyu.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Yemwe basambanyi! Ntimuzi ko gukunda ivy’isi ari ukuba umwansi w’Imana? Uwuhisemwo gucudika n’isi aba abaye umwansi w’Imana. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Canke mwibaza ko Ivyanditswe bibesha iyo bivuga ko Imana itwiyegerezanya ishaka ryo kutwiganzira rwose kubera Mpwemu wayo yadushizemwo? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ariko ubuntu iduha burarengeye. Ni co gituma Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“Imana igwanya abibona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">ariko ikagirira ubuntu abaciye bugufi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Imigani 3:34</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nuko, mwicishe bugufi imbere y’Imana. Mugwanye wa mubi, na we azobahunga. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mwegere Imana na yo izobegera. Yemwe banyavyaha, nimukarabe; namwe abatiyeguriye Imana mu mitima, nimwiyeze. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mubabare mugandare kandi muboroge kubera ivyo mwakoze. Ibitwengo vyanyu mubihindure ikigandaro kandi n’umunezero wanyu muwuhindure umubabaro. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mwicishe bugufi imbere y’Umwami, na we azobashira hejuru.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Bene Data nkunda, ntimuvuge abandi nabi. Iyo mutanguye kuvugana nabi canke mugaciranira imanza, muba muvuze nabi ivyagezwe n’Imana, kandi muba mubiciriye urubanza. Igihe muciriye urubanza ivyagezwe, aho kuvyumvira, muba mubaye abacamanza bavyo. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Imana yonyene ni yo yatanze ivyagezwe kandi ni yo ibicira urubanza. Ni yo yonyene ishobora gukiza no guhonya. Ariko wewe uri nde aho ucira urubanza mugenzawe?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntimwiratire ivy’ejo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Umvirize, mwebwe muvuga muti: “Uyu musi canke ejo tuzoja mu gisagara kanaka, tuzomarayo umwaka, tudandaze twironkere inyungu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Ivyo mwobivuga gute kandi mutazi ingene ubuzima bwanyu buzoba bumeze ejo? Ubuzima bwanyu ni iki? Muri igipfungu kiboneka umwanya muto hanyuma kigakamangana. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Ahubwo, mwari mukwiye kuvuga muti: “Umwami niyabishaka, tuzobaho dukore ibi na biriya.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ariko murishima mukishira hejuru. Ukwishima kwanyu ni kubi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Umuntu wese azi iciza yategerezwa gukora ntagikore, aba acumuye.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku batunzi bacinyiza abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ubu na ho nimunyumve, yemwe batunzi, murire muboroge kubera ivyago bigiye kubashikako. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ubutunzi bwanyu buraboze, n’impuzu zanyu ziriwe n’umuswa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Inzahabu n’ifeza vyanyu vyaguye ingese kandi ingese zavyo zizobatsindisha kandi zibarye bwa muriro. Mwirundanirije ubutunzi mu misi ya nyuma. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ehe impembo z’abakozi bo mu mirima yanyu mwanse guhemba ziriko ziratakamba zibarega. Ugutaka kw’abimbuzi b’imirima yanyu kwashitse mu matwi y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mwabaye mw’isi muri mu bihimbaro bikomeye, muhaza icipfuzo cose. Mwarigaburiye muravyibuha kurya kw’ibitungwa bategurira kubagwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mwaratsindishije abagororotsi murongera murabica, kuko badashobora no kubagwanya.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwihanganira imibabaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nuko rero bene Data, mwihangane gushika aho Umwami wacu azozira. Raba ingene umurimyi arindira ko umurima wiwe wera ivyimburwa kandi arorera yihanganye imvura y’agatasi n’iy’impeshi. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Namwe nimwihangane kandi muhagarare mushikamye, kuko ukuza k’Umwami kuri hafi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Bene Data, ntimwidodomberanire, kugira ngo ntimuze mutsindwe n’urubanza. Umucamanza ari ku rugi.<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Bene Data, mu vyo kwihanganira imibabaro, mufatire akarorero ku bavugishwa n’Imana bavuga mw’izina ry’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Nk’uko mubizi, abashoboye kwihangana tubita abahirwe. Mwarumvise ukwihangana kwa Yobu kandi mwarabonye ivyo Umwami Imana yamuhaye mu nyuma. Umwami Imana yuzuye impuhwe n’ikigongwe.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Ikirengeye vyose, bene Data, ntimukarahire ijuru canke isi canke ikindi kintu ic’ari co cose. Ico mukwiye kuvuga gusa ni: “Ego” canke “Oya,” ikirenze ivyo ni ico kubatsindisha.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho ririmwo ukwizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Mbega hoba hariho uwo muri mwebwe afise ingorane? Nasenge. Hoba hariho uwuri mu munezero? Naririmbe indirimbo zo gutazira. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Hoba hariho uwo muri mwebwe agwaye? Nahamagare abarongozi bakuru b’ishengero bamusengere bamusige n’amavuta mw’izina ry’Umwami. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Isengesho ririmwo ukwizera rizotuma uwo murwayi akira; Umwami azomuvyura. Niyaba yarakoze ivyaha azobiharirwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nuko rero mwaturanire ivyaha vyanyu, musengeranire kugira ngo mukire ingwara. Isengesho ry’umugororotsi ririmwo ububasha kandi rikora vyinshi.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya yari umuntu nkatwe. Yasenze yinginga kugira ngo imvura ntigwe, kandi ntiyaguye muri ico gihugu kumara imyaka itatu n’igice. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Yongera gusenga, maze ijuru rirekura imvura, isi na yo izana ivyimburwa vyayo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Bene Data, nihaba hariho uwataye inzira y’ukuri maze uwundi akamugarukana, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mwibuke ibi: uwukuye umunyavyaha mu nzira yiwe y’ubuzimire aba amukijije urupfu kandi atuma ivyaha vyiwe vyinshi biharirwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>